Open Location Code (Plus Codes)
-------------------------------
The Plus Code implementation in rust/crates/sharewhere-geo is an original
implementation of the published Open Location Code specification
(https://github.com/google/open-location-code, Apache-2.0). The specification is
frozen and the algorithm is not patented. No upstream source code was copied;
the published reference test vectors are used to verify correctness.


Organic Maps ge0 encoding
-------------------------
The ge0 short-link codec in rust/crates/sharewhere-geo is an original
implementation of the encoding used by Organic Maps
(https://github.com/organicmaps/organicmaps, Apache-2.0), written from the
format description. No upstream source code was copied.
